            "content_descriptors": {
                "ids": [
                    5
                ],
                "notes": "The game contains no explicit depictions of nudity or sex, but several characters appear in a partially clothed state and sex is mentioned on a few occasions.\r\nThere are no graphic depictions of violence, but character death occurs on a couple occasions and is partially described in a fade-to-black manner.\r\nThere is no graphic depiction of alcohol consumption/abuse, but it and its negative consequences are described in a couple places (don't do drugs, kids!)\r\n\r\nThe only way to access this content is to progress down the routes/read the story as it almost exclusively appears in text form. Almost all content that can be described as mature/risque appears in later parts of the story and cannot be easily viewed bar fast-forwarding through the game."
            },
